      <div style=\"text-align: left;\">\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 56px; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1; margin: 0 0 14px;\">01</p>\n      <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; margin: 0 0 14px;\">BUILD YOUR PRODUCT LINE</p>\n      <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; opacity: .85;\">Direct access to over 250 doctor-formulated supplements with low minimums and no set-up fees. Choose what fits your audience and your timeline.</p>\n    </div><div style=\"text-align: left;\">\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 56px; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1; margin: 0 0 14px;\">02</p>\n      <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; margin: 0 0 14px;\">DESIGN YOUR BRAND</p>\n      <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; opacity: .85;\">Use your existing logo, customize a new label, or pick from our professional templates. Our in-house design team brings your vision to life.</p>\n    </div><div style=\"text-align: left;\">\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 56px; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1; margin: 0 0 14px;\">03</p>\n      <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; margin: 0 0 14px;\">START SELLING FAST</p>\n      <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; opacity: .85;\">Launch in as little as 3 to 4 weeks after approving your labels. Every product passes rigorous quality assurance before it ships.</p>\n    </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"id":216201609217,"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: #f7f7f6; padding: 70px 20px 30px; text-align: center;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; margin: 0 0 12px;\">WHY ENERGY & VITALITY</p>\n    <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 34px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.2; margin: 0;\">Why energy & vitality supplements are a strong category to build a brand around.</h2>\n    \n  </div>\n</div>"},"id":216201609218,"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: #f7f7f6; padding: 20px 20px 70px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 28px;\">\n      <div style=\"background: white; padding: 34px 30px; border-radius: 6px; border-top: 4px solid #6BA644; box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(1,38,56,.06);\">\n      <div style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:56px;height:56px;background:#c9dbe2;border-radius:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;\"><path d=\"M3.75 13.5 13.5 3l-2.25 7.5h6L9 21l2.25-7.5h-7.5Z\"/></svg></div>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 12px;\">Beyond-caffeine positioning</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">Most energy products are just caffeine-and-sugar. Brands that offer sustainable, crash-free energy through mitochondrial support and adaptogens stand out and command premium pricing.</p>\n    </div><div style=\"background: white; padding: 34px 30px; border-radius: 6px; border-top: 4px solid #6BA644; box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(1,38,56,.06);\">\n      <div style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:56px;height:56px;background:#c9dbe2;border-radius:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;\"><path d=\"M15.36 5.21A14.92 14.92 0 0 0 14 4.5a8.27 8.27 0 0 1-1.74 4.42 8.27 8.27 0 0 0-1.51 5.34A4.5 4.5 0 0 1 7.5 