your consultation.</p>\n    <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 24px;\">\n      <div style=\"background: white; border-radius: 8px; padding: 28px 26px; border: 1px solid #ebebe8; transition: box-shadow .2s;\">\n      <div style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 48px; height: 48px; background: #c9dbe2; border-radius: 10px; margin: 0 0 16px;\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:24px;height:24px;\"><path d=\"M3.75 13.5 13.5 3l-2.25 7.5h6L9 21l2.25-7.5h-7.5Z\"/></svg>\n      </div>\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; margin: 0 0 8px;\">MITOCHONDRIAL</p>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 8px;\">Mito-Fuel</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0 0 16px;\">Performance drink mix with proprietary D-Ribose plus ATP for mitochondrial function, energy and muscle recovery.</p>\n      <div><span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #f7f7f6; color: #012638; font-size: 12px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 4px 6px 0;\">D-Ribose</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #f7f7f6; color: #012638; font-size: 12px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 4px 6px 0;\">ATP</span></div>\n    </div><div style=\"background: white; border-radius: 8px; padding: 28px 26px; border: 1px solid #ebebe8; transition: box-shadow .2s;\">\n      <div style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 48px; height: 48px; background: #c9dbe2; border-radius: 10px; margin: 0 0 16px;\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:24px;height:24px;\"><path d=\"