; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0 0 16px;\">Chocolate drink mix with 5 amino acids as secretagogues to support natural HGH release.</p>\n      <div><span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #f7f7f6; color: #012638; font-size: 12px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 4px 6px 0;\">Amino Acids</span></div>\n    </div><div style=\"background: white; border-radius: 8px; padding: 28px 26px; border: 1px solid #ebebe8; transition: box-shadow .2s;\">\n      <div style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 48px; height: 48px; background: #c9dbe2; border-radius: 10px; margin: 0 0 16px;\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:24px;height:24px;\"><path d=\"M21 7.5 12 12m0 0L3 7.5M12 12v9.75m0-9.75 9-4.5M3 7.5l9 4.5M3 7.5v9l9 4.5m9-13.5v9L12 21.75\"/></svg>\n      </div>\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; margin: 0 0 8px;\">PROTEIN</p>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 8px;\">Creatine Powder</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0 0 16px;\">Vegan single-ingredient drink mix with creatine powder to fuel your body, build lean muscle and support a sharp mind.</p>\n      <div><span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #f7f7f6; color: #012638; font-size: 12px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 4px 6px 0;\">Creatine</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #f7f7f6; color: #012638; font-size: 12px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 4px 6px 0;\">Powder</span></div>\n    </div><div style=\"background: white; border-radius: 8px; padding: 28px 26px; border: 1px solid #ebebe8; transition: box-shadow .2s;\">\n      <div style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 48px; height: 48px; background: #c9dbe2; border-radius: 10px; margin: 0 0 16px;\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:24px;height:24px;\"><path d=\"M21 8.25c0-2.49-2.02-4.5-4.5-4.5-1.83 0-3.4 1.09-4.13 2.66A4.49 4.49 0 0 0 7.5 3.75 4.5 4.5 0 0 0 3 8.25c0 6.97 9 12 9 12s9-5.03 9-12Z\"/></svg>\n      </div>\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; margin: 0 0 8px;\">CARDIO ENERGY</p>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 8px;\">Coenzyme Q10 - DMG 300/300</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0 0 16px;\">Orange tablets with CoQ10, DMG and Vitamin E for heart health, immune function and energy production.</p>\n      <div><span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #f7f7f6; color: #012638; font-size: 12px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 4px 6px 0;\">CoQ10</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #f7f7f6; color: #012638; font-size: 12px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 4px 6px 0;\">DMG</span></div>\n    </div><div style=\"background: white; border-radius: 8px; padding: 28px 26px; border: 1px solid #ebebe8; transition: box-shadow .2s;\">\n      <div style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 48px; height: 48px; background: #c9dbe2; border-radius: 10px; margin: 0 0 16px;\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:24px;height:24px;\"><path d=\"M8.59 12.41a6 6 0 0 1 8.49-8.49l-1.06 1.06m-4.94 11.42L8.59 12.41m6.36 6.36-3.32-3.32m-1.4-1.4a6 6 0 0 0-3.74 1.43A6 6 0 0 0 4 21l1.5-1.5m11.13-11.13L21 4\"/></svg>\n      </div>\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; margin: 0 0 8px;\">RECOVERY</p>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 8px;\">Maxi-BCAA</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0 0 16px;\">Post-workout drink mix with BCAAs, electrolytes and L-glutamine for muscle recovery and energy.</p>\n      <div><span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #f7f7f6; color: #012638; font-size: 12px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 4px 6px 0;\">BCAAs</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #f7f7f6; color: #012638; font-size: 12px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 4px 6px 0;\">L-Glutamine</span></div>\n    </div><div style=\"background: white; border-radius: 8px; padding: 28px 26px; border: 1px solid #ebebe8; transition: box-shadow .2s;\">\n      <div style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 48px; height: 48px; background: #c9dbe2; border-radius: 10px; margin: 0 0 16px;\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:24px;height:24px;\"><path d=\"M3.75 13.5 13.5 3l-2.25 7.5h6L9 21l2.25-7.5h-7.5Z\"/></svg>\n      </div>\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; margin: 0 0 8px;\">B-COMPLEX</p>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 8px;\">B Complex-75</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0 0 16px;\">11 B Vitamins including B12, biotin, and folate for nervous system function and stress management.</p>\n      <div><span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #f7f7f6; color: #012638; font-size: 12px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 4px 6px 0;\">B-Complex</span></div>\n    </div><div style=\"background: white; border-radius: 8px; padding: 28px 26px; border: 1px solid #ebebe8; transition: box-shadow .2s;\">\n      <div style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 48px; height: 48px; background: #c9dbe2; border-radius: 10px; margin: 0 0 16px;\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:24px;height:24px;\"><path d=\"M9.81 4.94 9 2.25l-.81 2.69a4.5 4.5 0 0 1-3 3L2.5 8.75l2.69.81a4.5 4.5 0 0 1 3 3l.81 2.69.81-2.69a4.5 4.5 0 0 1 3-3l2.69-.81-2.69-.81a4.5 4.5 0 0 1-3-3ZM18 7.5l-.51 1.71a3 3 0 0 1-2.03 2.03L13.75 11.75l1.71.51a3 3 0 0 1 2.03 2.03L18 16l.51-1.71a3 3 0 0 1 2.03-2.03L22.25 11.75l-1.71-.51a3 3 0 0 1-2.03-2.03L18 7.5ZM16.5 18.75 16.04 20l-.46 1.25-.46-1.25-.46-1.25.46-1.25.46 1.25Z\"/></svg>\n      </div>\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; margin: 0 0 8px;\">METABOLIC</p>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 8px;\">Metabolic Multi</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0 0 16px;\">Comprehensive formula with bioavailable plant extracts, vitamins, minerals and amino acids for metabolism and energy.</p>\n      <div><span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #f7f7f6; color: #012638; font-size: 12px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 4px 6px 0;\">Metabolic</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #f7f7f6; color: #012638; font-size: 12px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 4px 6px 0;\">Energy</span></div>\n    </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"id":216201609220,"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: #012638; color: white; padding: 90px 20px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 60px; align-items: center;\">\n    <div><img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/DV_PL_HeroBackground_2.jpg\" alt=\"Energy & Vitality supplements\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 6px;\"/></div><div>\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; margin: 0 0 14px;\">WHY DAVINCI FOR ENERGY & VITALITY</p>\n      <h2 style=\"font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.2; margin: 0 0 20px;\">Sustainable energy through mitochondrial, cellular, and adaptogenic support.</h2>\n      <p style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.65; opacity: .9; margin: 0;\">The energy market is crowded with caffeine. Our formulations support the body's natural energy production: mitochondrial function, NAD+ cellular energy, B-vitamin foundations, and adaptogenic stress resilience. Brand around sustainable energy and customers stay loyal.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"id":216201609221,"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: #f7f7f6; padding: 80px 20px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; text-align: center; margin: 0 0 16px;\">Build across multiple health categories</h2>\n    <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 17px; text-align: center; max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto 48px;\">Most brands start with one category and expand. Combine energy & vitality with adjacent categories to grow lifetime value per customer.</p>\n    <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr)); gap: 24px;\">\n      <a href=\"/pl-demo-fitness\" style=\"display: block; text-decoration: none;\">\n      <div style=\"background: white; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(1,38,56,.08);\">\n        <img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/fitnesssupps.png\" alt=\"Fitness\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 160px; object-fit: cover; display: block;\"/>\n        <div style=\"padding: 18px 20px; text-align: center;\">\n          <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0;\">Fitness</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </a><a href=\"/pl-demo-herbal\" style=\"display: block; text-decoration: none;\">\n      <div style=\"background: white; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(1,38,56,.08);\">\n        <img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/herbalsupps.png\" alt=\"Herbal\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 160px; object-fit: cover; display: block;\"/>\n        <div style=\"padding: 18px 20px; text-align: center;\">\n          <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0;\">Herbal</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </a><a href=\"/pl-demo-aging\" style=\"display: block; text-decoration: none;\">\n      <div style=\"background: white; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(1,38,56,.08);\">\n        <img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/agingsupps.png\" alt=\"Aging\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 160px; object-fit: cover; display: block;\"/>\n        <div style=\"padding: 18px 20px; text-align: center;\">\n          <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0;\">Aging</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </a><a href=\"/pl-demo-sleep\" style=\"display: block; text-decoration: none;\">\n      <div style=\"background: white; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(1,38,56,.08);\">\n        <img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/sleepsupps.png\" alt=\"Sleep\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 160px; object-fit: cover; display: block;\"/>\n        <div style=\"padding: 18px 20px; text-align: center;\">\n          <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0;\">Sleep</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </a><a href=\"/pl-demo-womens-health\" style=\"display: block; text-decoration: none;\">\n      <div style=\"background: white; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(1,38,56,.08);\">\n        <img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/womenssupps.png\" alt=\"Women's Health\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 160px; object-fit: cover; display: block;\"/>\n        <div style=\"padding: 18px 20px; text-align: center;\">\n          <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0;\">Women's Health</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </a><a href=\"/pl-demo-probiotics\" style=\"display: block; text-decoration: none;\">\n      <div style=\"background: white; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(1,38,56,.08);\">\n        <img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/probioticsupps.png\" alt=\"Probiotics\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 160px; object-fit: cover; display: block;\"/>\n        <div style=\"padding: 18px 20px; text-align: center;\">\n          <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0;\">Probiotics</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"id":216201609222,"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{},"id":218950233497,"label":"PL - Global Product Guide Link","module_id":218942529660,"order":8,"type":"module"},{"body":{"html":"<div id=\"get-started\" style=\"background: #e6e5e3; padding: 80px 20px; text-align: center;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.25; margin: 0 0 16px;\">Ready to launch your energy & vitality supplement line?</h2>\n    <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0 0 32px;\">Schedule a consultation. Most brands launch within 3 to 4 weeks of approving labels, 8 to 12 weeks from first conversation.</p>\n    <a href=\"#get-started\" style=\"display: inline-block; background: #6BA644; color: white; padding: 16px 40px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; border-radius: 4px; letter-spacing: .5px;\">Schedule a Consultation</a>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"id":216201609224,"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{},"id":218950032290,"label":"PL - Global Guide Offer","module_id":218944099153,"order":10,"type":"module"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: #e6e5e3; padding: 90px 20px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center;\">\n    <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; margin: 0 0 14px;\">50+ YEARS OF SUPPLEMENT MANUFACTURING</p>\n    <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 34px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.2; margin: 0 0 24px;\">Developed by us. Made for you.</h2>\n    <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 18px;\">With over 50 years in the health supplement industry, we are one of the most trusted dietary supplement manufacturers. Every private label supplement we produce is doctor-formulated using thoroughly researched ingredients, then scientifically reviewed for efficacy and quality before it ever enters production in our U.S. facilities.</p>\n    <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 18px;\">FoodScience is an FDA-registered food facility, GMP certified to SQF food safety standards, and certified to NSF GMP 455-2.</p>\n    <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 40px;\">When you partner with us, our expert team is with you every step of the way. Help your customers find what they want from a source they trust. You.</p>\n    <div style=\"display: flex; gap: 50px; justify-content: center; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n      <img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/DV_PL_Logo_SQF.png\" alt=\"SQF Certified\" style=\"height: 80px; width: auto;\"/>\n      <img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/NSF.png\" alt=\"NSF GMP Certified\" style=\"height: 80px; width: auto;\"/>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"id":216201609226,"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: #f7f7f6; padding: 80px 20px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 820px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; text-align: center; margin: 0 0 16px;\">Frequently asked questions</h2>\n    <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 17px; text-align: center; margin: 0 0 44px;\">None</p>\n    <details style=\"background: white; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 14px; border: 1px solid #e6e5e3; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(1,38,56,.04);\">\n      <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; padding: 22px 28px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #012638; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n        <span>What does private labeling energy and vitality supplements actually involve?</span>\n        <span style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: 16px;\">+</span>\n      </summary>\n      <div style=\"padding: 0 28px 24px; color: #444; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65;\">Private labeling means you launch a energy and vitality product under your own brand using one of our pre-existing, doctor-formulated stock formulas. We handle manufacturing, quality testing, and bottling. You select the formulation from our catalog, design your label, and we produce the finished product ready to ship under your brand. No formulation work, no setup fees, no lab build-out.</div>\n    </details><details style=\"background: white; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 14px; border: 1px solid #e6e5e3; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(1,38,56,.04);\">\n      <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; padding: 22px 28px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #012638; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n        <span>What are typical minimums and lead times for energy and vitality products?</span>\n        <span style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: 16px;\">+</span>\n      </summary>\n      <div style=\"padding: 0 28px 24px; color: #444; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65;\">Most energy and vitality formulations have minimum order quantities in the low hundreds of bottles per SKU. Once your labels are approved, production typically takes three to four weeks before your first inventory ships. Custom packaging or formulation can extend that timeline. We give you exact MOQs and lead times for the SKUs you select during your consultation.</div>\n    </details><details style=\"background: white; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 14px; border: 1px solid #e6e5e3; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(1,38,56,.04);\">\n      <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; padding: 22px 28px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #012638; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n        <span>Can I customize the formulations or only the label?</span>\n        <span style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: 16px;\">+</span>\n      </summary>\n      <div style=\"padding: 0 28px 24px; color: #444; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65;\">Both paths are available. Private label means you use our existing energy and vitality formulations as-is and put your brand on them. Custom formulation means our R&D team develops new energy and vitality formulas to your exact specifications, with full proprietary ownership of the result. Custom carries higher minimums and longer timelines but gives you a real moat. Most clients start with private label and add custom formulations once they have traction.</div>\n    </details><details style=\"background: white; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 14px; border: 1px solid #e6e5e3; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(1,38,56,.04);\">\n      <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; padding: 22px 28px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #012638; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n        <span>Are these energy and vitality products FDA-compliant?</span>\n        <span style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: 16px;\">+</span>\n      </summary>\n      <div style=\"padding: 0 28px 24px; color: #444; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65;\">Yes. All our energy and vitality formulations are manufactured in our FDA-registered, GMP-certified Vermont facility. Our formulations meet dietary supplement labeling requirements under DSHEA. Each batch is tested for identity, potency, and contaminants. You receive Certificates of Analysis with your inventory. We help you understand the structure-function claims you can responsibly make on your label.</div>\n    </details><details style=\"background: white; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 14px; border: 1px solid #e6e5e3; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(1,38,56,.04);\">\n      <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; padding: 22px 28px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #012638; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n        <span>What if I need a energy and vitality formulation that is not in your catalog?</span>\n        <span style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: 16px;\">+</span>\n      </summary>\n      <div style=\"padding: 0 28px 24px; color: #444; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65;\">That is where custom formulation comes in. Our R&D team has developed hundreds of energy and vitality formulations over the past 50 years. If your concept is doable within DSHEA and our manufacturing capabilities, we can build it. Custom formulation projects typically take 12 to 16 weeks from concept to production-ready, with higher minimums to amortize the R&D investment.</div>\n    </details><details style=\"background: white; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 14px; border: 1px solid #e6e5e3; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(1,38,56,.04);\">\n      <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; padding: 22px 28px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #012638; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n        <span>How much does it cost to launch a energy and vitality private label line?</span>\n        <span style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: 16px;\">+</span>\n      </summary>\n      <div style=\"padding: 0 28px 24px; color: #444; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65;\">Total launch cost depends on the SKUs you choose, the packaging you select, and the volume you order. Most clients launch a 3-5 SKU energy and vitality line for under $15,000 in initial inventory, including custom label design. There are no setup fees, no annual contracts, and no formulation costs for private label. We provide transparent SKU-by-SKU pricing during your consultation.</div>\n    </details>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"id":216201609227,"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{},"id":218950233498,"label":"PL - Global FDA Disclaimer","module_id":218942529652,"order":13,"type":"module"}]}},"widgets":{}}